---
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../styles/index.css';
import cv from '../content/cv.json';
import { appIcons } from '../data/app-icons';

const contactLinks = [
    { name: 'Email', className: 'email', href: `mailto:${cv.personal.contact.email}`, icon: appIcons.email },
    { name: 'Telegram', className: 'telegram', href: `https://telegram.me/${cv.personal.contact.telegram}`, icon: appIcons.telegram },
    { name: 'WhatsApp', className: 'whatsapp', href: `https://wa.me/${cv.personal.contact.phone}`, icon: appIcons.whatsapp },
    { name: 'GitHub', className: 'github', href: `https://github.com/${cv.personal.contact.github}`, icon: appIcons.github },
];
---

<Layout title="Víctor Ballester Ribó" description="Personal website of Víctor Ballester Ribó, PhD student in Aeronautics at Imperial College London.">
	<Header />
	<main>
        <section>
            <h1>Víctor Ballester Ribó</h1>
            <h2>PhD student in Aeronautics at Imperial College London.</h2>
            <div>
                <figure>
                    <img src="/images/personal/victor-ballester.jpg" alt="Víctor Ballester Ribó">
                    <figcaption>Víctor Ballester Ribó, 2024</figcaption>
                </figure>
                <div class="info-vb">
                    <a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/BcZYDM2aGpPrA8MH9" target="_blank">
                        <span>
                            <img src="/images/logos/others/location.svg" alt="Location">
                        </span>
                        <span>London, UK</span>
                        <span>
                            <img src="/images/logos/flags/united-kingdom.svg" alt="United Kingdom flag" class="flag">
                        </span>
                    </a>
                    <a href="https://www.imperial.ac.uk/" target="_blank">
                        <span>
                            <img src="/images/logos/others/student.svg" alt="Student">
                        </span>
                        <span>PhD Student</span>
                        <span>
                            <img src="/images/logos/universities/imperial.svg" alt="Imperial College London" class="imperial">
                        </span>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <article>
            <p>
                Hey there! I'm Víctor, a PhD student in Aeronautics at <a href="https://www.imperial.ac.uk/" target="_blank" class="type university">Imperial College London</a>.
            </p>

            <p>
                Here's a bit about my academic journey so far:
            </p>

            <p>
                I grew up in Badalona, a city near Barcelona. I did my undergraduate studies in Mathematics at <a href="https://www.uab.cat/" target="_blank" class="type university">Autonomous University of Barcelona</a>. 
                Then I moved to Paris, where I pursued my master's degree in Applied and Theoretical Mathematics at <a href="https://dauphine.psl.eu/" target="_blank" class="type university">Dauphine-PSL University</a>.
            </p>

            <p>
                During my undergraduate studies, I worked on a project titled <a href="https://github.com/victorballester7/final-bachelor-thesis" target="_blank" class="type project">Numerical Propagation of Trajectories of Earth-Orbiting Spacecraft</a> under the guidance of <a href="https://bgsmath.cat/people/?person=josep-maria-mondelo" target="_blank" class="type person">J. M. Mondelo</a>. 
            </p>

            <p>
                During my stay in Paris, I specialized in Computational Fluid Dynamics. My final project, <a href="https://github.com/victorballester7/final-master-thesis" target="_blank" class="type project">2D Turbulence Spreading</a>, was supervised by <a href="https://www.phys.ens.fr/~alexakis/" target="_blank" class="type person">A. Alexakis</a> and <a href="https://www.math.ens.psl.eu/~dormy/" target="_blank" class="type person">E. Dormy</a>.
            </p>

            <p>
                In October 2024, I moved even norther, to London, where I began my PhD. My PhD focuses on the transition to turbulence over gaps using direct numerical simulations with a spectral/hp element method approach. I am being supervised by <a href="https://www.imperial.ac.uk/people/s.sherwin" target="_blank" class="type person">S. Sherwin</a> and <a href="https://www.imperial.ac.uk/people/y.hwang" target="_blank" class="type person">Y. Hwang</a>.
            </p>
        </article>

        <section>
            <img src="/images/personal/victor-ballester-beyond-academia.jpg" alt="Paisatge">
            <div>
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 497 428">
                    <path d="M142 383C130 392 116 398 100 398 61 398 30 367 30 328 30 290 61 258 100 258 129 258 154 276 164 302L186 279C169 249 137 228 100 228 45 228 0 273 0 328 0 383 45 428 100 428 126 428 149 418 167 401 160 399 153 396 148 390 146 388 144 386 142 383"/>
                    <path d="M293 229 240 199C264 184 255 189 279 175L278 182C277 195 286 206 298 209 298 209 391 225 394 225 406 225 417 216 419 204 421 190 412 177 398 175L330 164 333 131C337 111 338 104 330 92L321 76C308 56 281 50 261 62L155 129C129 146 116 180 137 205 146 215 227 265 227 265L161 333C149 345 150 364 162 376A30 30 0 00183 384C190 384 198 381 204 375L300 276C313 262 310 239 293 229M405 93C428 78 436 48 421 24 406 1 376-6 352 8 329 23 322 54 336 77 351 101 382 108 405 93"/>
                    <path d="M397 228C341 228 297 274 297 328 297 383 342 428 397 428 452 428 497 383 497 328 497 273 452 228 397 228M397 397C359 397 327 366 327 327 327 289 358 257 397 257 435 257 467 288 467 327 467 365 436 397 397 397"/>
                </svg>
                <h3>Beyond Academia</h3>
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 11 12">
                    <path d="M 5.55 1.157 A 1.157 1.157 0 0 1 4.392 2.314 A 1.157 1.157 0 0 1 3.236 1.157 A 1.157 1.157 0 0 1 4.392 0 A 1.157 1.157 0 0 1 5.55 1.157 M 0.76 2.753 L 2.205 2.907 L 2.388 2.927 Q 2.524 2.939 2.654 2.907 C 2.558 3.052 2.489 3.217 2.464 3.401 L 2.23 5.131 L 3.245 4.556 L 2.886 3.562 A 1 1 0 0 1 2.934 2.782 Q 2.958 2.769 2.98 2.752 A 0.8 0.8 0 0 0 3.207 2.45 A 0.8 0.8 0 0 0 3.275 2.21 A 0.805 0.805 0 0 0 2.559 1.323 L 0.931 1.15 A 0.806 0.806 0 1 0 0.761 2.753 M 10.803 5.178 A 0.397 0.397 0 0 0 10.247 5.256 L 8.757 7.236 A 0.4 0.4 0 0 0 8.692 7.367 L 8.078 9.537 L 7.137 9.671 A 0.4 0.4 0 0 0 6.997 9.719 L 4.272 11.257 A 0.397 0.397 0 1 0 4.662 11.949 L 7.323 10.447 L 8.446 10.287 A 0.4 0.4 0 0 0 8.772 10.001 L 9.436 7.655 L 10.881 5.735 A 0.397 0.397 0 0 0 10.803 5.178 M 6.34 9.525 L 6.095 7.836 A 0.7 0.7 0 0 0 5.793 7.358 L 4.8 6.695 L 4.452 6.462 L 4.457 6.422 L 4.482 6.239 L 4.278 6.183 A 1 1 0 0 1 3.608 5.563 L 3.381 4.935 L 2.162 5.625 L 2.097 6.103 C 2.084 6.203 2.081 6.536 2.126 6.679 L 2.408 7.586 L 2.788 8.803 L 2.258 10.822 A 0.695 0.695 0 1 0 3.601 11.176 L 4.182 8.964 A 0.7 0.7 0 0 0 4.174 8.58 L 3.924 7.78 L 4.764 8.341 L 4.964 9.724 A 0.695 0.695 0 0 0 6.34 9.524 M 4.38 3.023 A 0.595 0.595 0 1 0 3.26 3.427 L 3.982 5.428 A 0.6 0.6 0 0 0 4.385 5.8 L 6.257 6.315 A 0.594 0.594 0 1 0 6.573 5.167 L 4.998 4.734 Z M 1.705 6.05 L 1.773 5.546 L 0.485 4.016 L 0.295 5.802 A 0.806 0.806 0 0 0 1.011 6.689 L 1.781 6.771 A 1.6 1.6 0 0 1 1.705 6.05 M 0.598 2.96 L 0.544 3.468 L 1.844 5.015 L 2.071 3.347 C 2.081 3.269 2.103 3.197 2.124 3.123 Z"/>
                </svg>
            </div>
            <p>Outside of academia, I enjoy cycling and hiking a lot! </p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <p>
                If you'd like to get in touch, feel free to reach out to me via any of these platforms:
            </p>
            
            <address>
                {contactLinks.map(contact => (
                    <a href={contact.href} class={contact.className} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox={contact.icon.viewBox} aria-label={contact.name} role="img">
                            {contact.icon.paths.map((path, index) => (
                                <path class={contact.className === 'telegram' ? `telegram-path-${index + 1}` : undefined} d={path} />
                            ))}
                        </svg>
                        <span>{contact.name}</span>
                    </a>
                ))}
            </address>
        </section>
        <section>
            <p>
                And last but not least, I would like to refer to my brother <a href="mailto:david.ballester.ribo642@gmail.com" target="_blank" class="type person">David Ballester Ribó</a> for having designed and developed this super cool website!
            </p>
        </section>
    </main>
	<Footer />
</Layout>
